{
  "about": "Hand-written natural-language delivery requests with gold JSON instance specs, authored for this repo. 20 are inside the grammar the RuleBackend targets; 11 are deliberately outside it, each labelled with the failure mode it is meant to provoke. The corpus was written before the parser, and the parser was not revised against the hard cases.",
